Alembic migrations for JobTracker.

Common commands (run inside the api container):

  docker compose exec api alembic current
  docker compose exec api alembic history
  docker compose exec api alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add users"
  docker compose exec api alembic upgrade head
  docker compose exec api alembic downgrade -1

env.py is configured for async (asyncpg). Add new model module imports to
env.py so autogenerate sees them.
